---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CaseHeader from '../../components/CaseHeader.astro';
import ProductFrame from '../../components/ProductFrame.astro';
import InvestigationSystem from '../../components/InvestigationSystem.astro';
import {failureRecord,interventionRecord,evidenceBoundary} from '../../data/syncareerInvestigation';
import {projectRecords} from '../../data/portfolio';
import {syncareer} from '../../data/registry';
const title='Syncareer — Career tools, with context | Stephen Mensah';
const description=projectRecords.syncareer.summary;
const structuredData={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'CreativeWork',name:'Syncareer',description,url:new URL(syncareer.route,Astro.site).href,author:{'@type':'Person',name:'Stephen Mensah'},codeRepository:'https://github.com/stevemensah333-rgb/syncareer'};
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {structuredData} ogType="article" image="/images/syncareer/dashboard-1440.png" imageWidth={2400} imageHeight={1302}>
 <article><CaseHeader id="syncareer" sections={[{id:'product',label:'01 Product'},{id:'failure',label:'02 Failure'},{id:'investigation',label:'03 Investigation'},{id:'intervention',label:'04 Intervention'},{id:'result',label:'05 Result'}]}/>
 <div class="page-shell">
 <section class="case-section" id="failure"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Failure</p><h2>The assistant saw a bullet.<br />Not the evidence.</h2></div><div class="case-section__body"><p>{failureRecord.explanation}</p><aside class="boundary"><p><strong>Evidence class: documented failure pattern.</strong> {failureRecord.known}</p></aside><div class="compare-grid"><div class="compare-sheet"><h3>What went in</h3><p>One selected bullet.</p><p class="muted">No job requirement. No evidence records. No provenance.</p></div><div class="compare-sheet"><h3>What could come out</h3><p>Fluent wording with unsupported claims.</p><p class="muted">An illustrative example appears in the investigation. No historical output was captured.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="case-section" id="investigation"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Investigation</p><h2>Follow the<br />trust boundary.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/lab/">Inspect in the Lab ↗</a></div><div class="case-section__body"><p>One bounded request, a validated proposal and a person deciding what to keep. Open a stage for its source artifact and reasoning.</p><InvestigationSystem/></div></section>
 <section class="case-section" id="intervention"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Intervention</p><h2>Give the application<br />something to check.</h2></div><div class="case-section__body"><p>{interventionRecord.lede}</p><div class="compare-grid"><div class="compare-sheet"><h3>Before</h3>{interventionRecord.comparison.items.map(i=><p><strong>{i.name}</strong><br/>{i.before}</p>)}</div><div class="compare-sheet compare-sheet--after"><h3>After</h3>{interventionRecord.comparison.items.map(i=><p><strong>{i.name}</strong><br/>{i.after}</p>)}</div></div><details><summary>Engineering decisions & architecture</summary><p>{interventionRecord.stack}</p>{interventionRecord.responses.map(r=><div class="decision"><h3>{r.name}</h3><p>{r.note}</p></div>)}</details></div></section>
 <section class="case-section" id="result"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / Result</p><h2>A repaired contract.<br />A release still pending.</h2></div><div class="case-section__body"><p>{projectRecords.syncareer.boundary}</p><aside class="boundary"><p>{evidenceBoundary.statement}</p></aside><details><summary>Source evidence & unmeasured outcomes</summary><h3 id="result-verified">Present in source</h3><ul>{evidenceBoundary.known.map(i=><li>{i.text} <small>— {i.cite}</small></li>)}</ul><h3 id="result-unmeasured">Still unverified</h3><ul>{evidenceBoundary.missing.map(i=><li>{i.text}</li>)}</ul><p>{evidenceBoundary.numbers.body}</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/stevemensah333-rgb/syncareer/blob/main/docs/CONTEXTUAL_ASSISTANT_V2.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the source handoff ↗</a></details></div></section>
 <section class="section" id="product-surfaces"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">More of the product</p><h2 id="surfaces-title">The workflow<br />around the assistant.</h2></div><p>Real product captures. UI scores are product readouts, not measured hiring probabilities.</p></div><div class="surface-pair"><ProductFrame src1440="/images/syncareer/synai-context-1440.png" src1800="/images/syncareer/synai-context-1800.png" src2400="/images/syncareer/synai-context-2400.png" width={2400} height={1302} alt="Syncareer SynAI career guidance interface" label="SynAI / context" caption="Profile context and quick actions in the existing platform."/><ProductFrame src1440="/images/syncareer/opportunities-1440.png" src1800="/images/syncareer/opportunities-1800.png" src2400="/images/syncareer/opportunities-2400.png" width={2400} height={1303} alt="Syncareer opportunities and CV tailoring interface" label="Opportunities / application workflow" caption="Saved opportunities connect CV tailoring with interview preparation."/></div></section>
 <a class="next-project" href="/work/sessionbook/"><span><span class="eyebrow">Next project</span><strong>SessionBook</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
 </div></article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.surface-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem}.decision{margin-top:1.5rem}.decision h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}@media(max-width:700px){.surface-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
